    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This impressive detached two-storey 3 bedroom residence was built in 2019, extends to 1480 sq ft and boasts an excellent A2 energy rating. The property is approached via gated access and occupies a private site, with a tarmac driveway to the front and lawns extending to the side and rear.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the home offers a superb blank canvas for its new owners to personalise and finish according to their own taste and style.\r\n\r\nGranges Road is a highly sought-after residential location, within walking distance of St. Luke’s Hospital, Aut Even Hospital, Ayresfield Clinic, Loreto Secondary School, CBS Secondary School and St. Canice’s Primary School. The property is also conveniently located within easy walking distance of Kilkenny city centre and all its amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION COMPRISES OF THE FOLLOWING : -\r\n\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway\t8’3” x 16’8” (2.52m x 5.12m)\r\nA bright and spacious entrance hallway featuring a porcelain-tiled floor and carpeted staircase leading to the first floor. The hallway provides access to the sitting room, kitchen/dining room, under-stairs storage and plant room.\r\n\r\nSitting Room\t\t12’7” x 15’2” (3.90m x 4.65m)\r\nA well-proportioned reception room with laminate timber flooring, recessed lighting and two windows overlooking the front of the property. French doors provide access to the dining area.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\t13’3” x 18’9” (4.06m x 5.77m) & \r\n\t\t\t8’7” x 13’1” (2.64m x 4.00m)\r\nA generously proportioned open-plan kitchen and dining area with porcelain-tiled flooring, a range of fitted floor- and eye-level units, tiled splashback and recessed lighting. The kitchen is equipped with an integrated electric oven, hob, extractor fan and dishwasher. French doors connect to the sitting room, while patio doors open onto the rear garden. A door leads to the utility room.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\t\t8’7” x 13’9” (2.66m x 4.25m), including guest WC\r\nFeaturing a porcelain-tiled floor, the utility room is fitted with built-in units, countertop, tiled splashback, washing machine and dryer. There is access to the guest WC and a door leading to the side of the property.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\t\t4’9” x 4’7” (1.49m x 1.44m)\r\nFitted with a WC and wash-hand basin, with attractive floor-to-ceiling tiling.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nThe landing features carpet flooring, access to the hot press and stairs leading to the attic, which is floored out and has electricity.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t\t3’9” x 10’9” (4.23m x 3.32m)\r\nA spacious front-facing double bedroom overlooking James Park, with laminate timber flooring and built-in wardrobes. The room benefits from a stylish en-suite bathroom.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite Bathroom\t7’ x 7’4” (2.14m x 2.26m)\r\nA generously sized en-suite comprising a wash-hand basin, WC and double shower enclosure with mains shower. The room is finished with attractive floor-to-ceiling tiling.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t\t10’8” x 9’7” (3.30m x 2.96m)\r\nA well-appointed rear-facing bedroom with laminate timber flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t\t11’2” x 10’9” (3.43m x 3.31m)\r\nAnother spacious rear-facing bedroom, also featuring laminate timber flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\t\t8’9” x 7’7” (2.70m x 2.34m)\r\nThe main family bathroom is fitted with a wash-hand basin, WC, bath and separate shower area with mains shower. The room is finished with attractive floor-to-ceiling tiling."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tA2-rated detached home, built in 2019\r\n•\tThree bedrooms and three bathrooms\r\n•\tPresented in excellent condition throughout\r\n•\tOffers a superb blank canvas for the new owners to add their own personal style and finish\r\n•\tPrivate independent site with gated entrance\r\n•\tTarmac driveway and enclosed lawns to the front, side and rear\r\n•\tStairs leading to the attic, with attic floor boarded and electricity connected\r\n•\tRear shed with electricity supply\r\n•\tRoller blinds fitted to all windows\r\n•\tWired for Security Alarm\r\n\r\nSERVICES \r\n•\tMains water and mains sewerage\r\n•\tAir-to-water heating system\r\n•\tIndividual thermostatic controls throughout, allowing each room to be independently controlled"
      },
